id=X6886_GSI_PATCH_level_1_by_lemonrsh
name=X6886 GSI PATCH by lemonrsh v11.6 FIX
version=v11.6
versionCode=118
author=lemonrsh
description=X6886 GSI patch v11.6: GPU governor with a SAFER profile (volume-key choice at install: whole-system top OPP on load, lowest OPP screen-off) and MAX (pinned top OPP); single 50 C thermal limit; works where /proc/gpufreqv2 is denied. On top of the v11.2.2 HBM watchdog, FOD/SOFOD guards and AOD-aware dexopt; DT2W removed.
